WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
- And here's the thing I love about you.

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.520
You're so normal.
(audience laughs)

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:05.670
When we were at the
AMAs, you were hosting.

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:06.503
- Yeah.

00:00:06.503 --> 00:00:07.850
- And I was like, "Oh my God, I love her."

00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:09.427
I'm sitting here going off,
and all of a sudden I'm like,

00:00:09.427 --> 00:00:11.617
"Why is Diana Ross gettin'
onstage with all her family?"

00:00:11.617 --> 00:00:13.427
(laughter)
I was like, I had no--

00:00:13.427 --> 00:00:16.041
- I love that.
- This is 2017.

00:00:16.041 --> 00:00:16.874
(audience laughs)

00:00:16.874 --> 00:00:18.820
Like, that this happened, and I had no,

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:20.483
I'm like a fan of you and I had no idea.

00:00:20.483 --> 00:00:21.780
- [Tracee] Love that.
- [Kelly] But that's--

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:22.740
- [Tracee] It means my career worked.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:23.860
- No, you're so good,

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:24.740
you're so talented!
- Thank you.

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:26.720
- I had no idea, and
then it kinda made sense

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:28.480
that talent doesn't
fall far from the tree.

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:30.000
But I was like, "Wow!"
(laughter)

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.420
Then I was like, "You're so normal."

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:32.980
I would've never guessed
that you would've grown up in

00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:34.287
Hollywood, I would've
never guessed you grew up--

00:00:34.287 --> 00:00:35.350
- Well I didn't grow up in Hollywood.

00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:37.578
I grew up in my mom's
house, you know what I mean?

00:00:37.578 --> 00:00:38.663
(laughter)
- Well okay, okay.

00:00:38.663 --> 00:00:40.020
- But we, and we weren't in Hollywood.

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:40.910
We didn't live here.
- Oh, really?

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:41.743
- Only when I was little.

00:00:41.743 --> 00:00:42.576
- And you didn't go out or
anything, you weren't that--

00:00:42.576 --> 00:00:45.290
- No, and I mean I was,
my mom is such a mom.

00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:46.758
She's a mom before she's anything else.

00:00:46.758 --> 00:00:47.591
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:47.591 --> 00:00:49.580
And so, I just had a really--
- That's why you're great!

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:51.010
- Yeah, I had like a
really regular upbringing.

00:00:51.010 --> 00:00:52.440
I got a lot of siblings,

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:53.273
you know what I mean?
- Me too.

00:00:53.273 --> 00:00:55.157
- My mom was always like,
"This money is not for you,

00:00:55.157 --> 00:00:56.340
"this money is for me."

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:57.173
- That's me!

00:00:57.173 --> 00:00:58.006
- Know what I mean?

00:00:58.006 --> 00:00:59.330
- My kids are like, "We have money,"

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:00.407
I'm like, "No, sir,

00:01:00.407 --> 00:01:01.479
"I have money."
- "No, no, no, I have money."

00:01:01.479 --> 00:01:02.312
(laughter)

00:01:02.312 --> 00:01:04.560
- "You're broke, you ain't got any money!"

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:05.730
- You didn't do a thing!

00:01:05.730 --> 00:01:07.430
- Yeah, I'm spending all of this,

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:08.263
you better get a job.
- That's what she

00:01:08.263 --> 00:01:09.360
that's exactly what she used to say to us!

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:10.380
- [Kelly] Yeah, yes.

00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:11.708
- She was like,
- I just bought a ranch!

00:01:11.708 --> 00:01:12.541
- "I don't know you better
figure out what you're doing!"

00:01:12.541 --> 00:01:14.490
- I hope y'all figure it out! Yeah I'm--

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:15.323
- She's like, "I'll pay for doctors

00:01:15.323 --> 00:01:16.537
"and make sure there's
a roof over your head."

00:01:16.537 --> 00:01:17.857
"Until a certain point!"
- Education, yep.

00:01:17.857 --> 00:01:18.690
- "And then go on."

00:01:18.690 --> 00:01:20.210
- I'll pay for health and education

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:21.364
- Yeah.
- Nothing else.

00:01:21.364 --> 00:01:22.197
- (laughs) That's it!

00:01:22.197 --> 00:01:23.130
- 'Cause you know what?
I turned out just fine.

00:01:23.130 --> 00:01:24.446
And I didn't have anything.
I worked hard, so, yes.

00:01:24.446 --> 00:01:26.240
(audience cheers)
- That's exactly right!

